msgstr "Vstupná úroveň čiernej"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:66
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:69
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:72
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:75
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:78
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "Percento"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:67
msgid ""
"Moves the black point to the right: all pixels with that value or less will "
"be black. This makes the dark areas even darker, influences the mid-tones a "
"little and the highlights not at all. Increases contrast."
msgstr ""
"Posúva čierny bod doprava: všetky pixely s touto hodnotou alebo nižšou budú "
"čierne. To robí tmavé oblasti ešte tmavšími, trochu ovplyvňuje polotóny a "
"vôbec neovplyvňuje svetlé oblasti. Zvyšuje kontrast."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:68
msgid "Input white level"
msgstr "Vstupná úroveň bielej"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:70
msgid ""
"Moves the white point to the left: all pixels with that value or higher will "
"be white. This makes bright areas even brighter, influences the mid-tones a "
"little and the dark areas not at all. Increases contrast."
msgstr ""
"Posúva biely bod doľava: všetky pixely s touto hodnotou alebo vyššou budú "
"biele. To robí svetlé oblasti ešte jasnejšími, trochu ovplyvňuje polotóny a "
"vôbec neovplyvňuje tmavé oblasti. Zvyšuje kontrast."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:71
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "Gama"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels.rst:73
msgid ""
"Changes the overall brightness of the image. Affects only the mid-tones, "
"black and white are not influenced. Default is 25%, equivalent to Gamma "
"1.0). Lower values (moving the bar to the left) make the image darker, "
"higher values (moving the bar to the right) make it brighter."
msgstr ""
"Mení celkový jas obrázka. Ovplyvňuje iba polotóny, čierna a biela nie sú "
"ovplyvnené. Predvolená hodnota je 25 %, čo zodpovedá gama 1,0. Nižšie "
"hodnoty (posúvanie lišty doľava) robia obrázok tmavším, vyššie hodnoty "
"(posúvanie lišty doprava) ho robia jasnejším."

